	"hardwareControls": [
		"37 full-size keys",
		"Octave buttons",
		"Pressure-sensitive pitch bend and modulation buttons",
		"Sustain button"
	],
	"notice": "Connect by USB or establish an operating-system BLE MIDI connection before browser detection. Configure assignments with Xkey Plus. The schematic keys and configurable buttons are unbound; no factory note range or CC assignments are assumed. Polyphonic aftertouch is a hardware capability; this profile does not supply a per-key pressure mapping. Bluetooth visibility depends on operating-system MIDI routing; ordinary browser Bluetooth pairing alone does not expose a Web MIDI port. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams are simplified connection and control schematics, not scale drawings.",
